 "fly_narration": "Her \u2014 follow, sing, reach.",
 "honest_note": "Hop-1 skips two high-weight ontology superclasses ('fruitless expressing neuron' tw=51702, 'sexually-dimorphic neuron' tw=25724) as generic parent buckets, same spirit as the GENERIC blocklist; duplicated ancestor/child tiers are represented by their most specific member. pIP10 (FBbt_00110854) IS a real downstream partner (tw=1444) but ranks below the top-k cutoff \u2014 same pattern as the giant fiber in the looming walk. The doublesex pC1 (male) neuron at hop 1 is the courtship integration center the spec asked about \u2014 it landed cleanly, no extra query needed. CIRCUIT VS DRIVE: every edge here is REAL measured wiring of P1's downstream command chain. The DRIVE DYNAMICS \u2014 how P1 activity ramps, persists, and satiates, and how it arbitrates against hunger/thirst \u2014 are the genuinely unmapped frontier; no API holds them, and nothing here models them.",
